{"id":"a5622ab6979073ce","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/275_Pocket_集合论.md","title":"275 Pocket 集合论","display":"275_Pocket_集合论","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始语言\">1. 原始语言</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{Pocket}(X)=v_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{Pocket}(X)=v_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{in}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{in}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in t\">\\(s\\in t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x A\">\\(\\forall x A\\)</span> 是这些构造子的显示记号。令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z_\\bot:=\\operatorname{fresh}_{Pocket}(\\varnothing),\n\\qquad\n\\bot:=\\forall z_\\bot\\,\\neg(z_\\bot\\doteq z_\\bot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z_\\bot:=\\operatorname{fresh}_{Pocket}(\\varnothing),\n\\qquad\n\\bot:=\\forall z_\\bot\\,\\neg(z_\\bot\\doteq z_\\bot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其余非原始记号在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\to,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\to,\\forall\\)</span> 中显式展开为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=\n\\neg\\bigl((A\\to B)\\to\\neg(B\\to A)\\bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B:=\n\\neg\\bigl((A\\to B)\\to\\neg(B\\to A)\\bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x\\,(x\\in a\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\,(x\\in a\\to\\neg A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x\\,(x\\in a\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\,(x\\in a\\to\\neg A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些均为宏而非新的公式构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}\\)</span> 一律作用于完全展开后的原始公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_\\bot\">\\(z_\\bot\\)</span> 被全称量词绑定，因而该闭公式的选择不引入自由变量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"1.1-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$\">1.1 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span></h1>\n<p>项自由变量与项替换分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\n\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\n\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义公式自由变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(s\\doteq t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(s\\in t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(s\\in t)=\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(\\forall x A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(\\forall x A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无捕获替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=t]\">\\(A[x:=t]\\)</span>。其原子与连接词子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\doteq v[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n(u\\in v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\in v[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\doteq v[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n(u\\in v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\in v[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=t]=\\neg(A[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=t]=\\neg(A[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yA,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\land\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\land\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall yA)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall yA,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\land\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\land\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{Pocket}(\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{Pocket}(\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket})\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket})\\)</span> 逐构造定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(u\\doteq v)=\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(u\\in v)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(u\\doteq v)=\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(u\\in v)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由改名与外层约束改名为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{Pocket}(A,x,y):=A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{Pocket}(A,x,y):=A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{Pocket}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\times(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket})^2)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{Pocket}\n\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\times(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket})^2)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{Pocket}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((\\forall xA,x,y),\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)])\\bigr):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},\\ x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},\\\ny\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{Pocket}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((\\forall xA,x,y),\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)])\\bigr):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},\\ x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},\\\ny\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}\\)</span> 为所有满足下列条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 上等价关系的交：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}\">\\(\\operatorname{eq}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{in}\">\\(\\operatorname{in}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{all}\">\\(\\operatorname{all}\\)</span> 相容，并包含所有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}\\forall y(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-有界公式\">2. 有界公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 的最小子集，满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in t\">\\(s\\in t\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\">\\(A,B\\in\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)\">\\(\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A)\">\\(\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\">\\(\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\subseteq b:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b)\">\\(a\\subseteq b:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-Pocket-公理族\">3. Pocket 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PocketSepOK}(A,a,b,x):\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\\ \\wedge\\ a,b,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\ \\wedge\\\n|\\{a,b,x\\}|=3\\ \\wedge\\ b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PocketSepOK}(A,a,b,x):\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\Delta_0^{Pocket}\\ \\wedge\\ a,b,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\ \\wedge\\\n|\\{a,b,x\\}|=3\\ \\wedge\\ b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Pocket 集合论只保留有限可携带的核心构造：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b(\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a\\doteq b)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b(\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a\\doteq b)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}=\\{\\exists e\\forall x\\neg(x\\in e)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}=\\{\\exists e\\forall x\\neg(x\\in e)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b\\exists p\\forall x(x\\in p\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq a\\vee x\\doteq b))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}=\\{\\forall a\\forall b\\exists p\\forall x(x\\in p\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq a\\vee x\\doteq b))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}=\\{\\forall a\\exists u\\forall x(x\\in u\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\wedge x\\in y))\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}=\\{\\forall a\\exists u\\forall x(x\\in u\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\wedge x\\in y))\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}=\\{\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\wedge A)):\n\\operatorname{PocketSepOK}(A,a,b,x)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}=\\{\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\wedge A)):\n\\operatorname{PocketSepOK}(A,a,b,x)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation}=\\{\\forall a(\\exists x(x\\in a)\\to\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge\\forall y(y\\in x\\to\\neg y\\in a)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation}=\\{\\forall a(\\exists x(x\\in a)\\to\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge\\forall y(y\\in x\\to\\neg y\\in a)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逻辑公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{Pocket}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{Pocket}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{Pocket}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{Pocket}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{Pocket}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{Pocket}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{Pocket}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{Pocket}=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{Pocket}=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{Pocket}=\n\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{Pocket}=\n\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{Pocket}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x A)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{Pocket}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x A)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{Pocket}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{Pocket}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{Pocket}=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{Pocket}=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{Pocket}\n=\n\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{Pocket}\n=\n\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 严格定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}:=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{Pocket}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}:=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{Pocket}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}^{-}:=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{Pocket}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}^{-}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}^{-}:=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Empty}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pair}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Union}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0Sep}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Foundation},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{Pocket}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}^{-}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-规则、证明与系统\">4. 规则、证明与系统</h1>\n<p>定义规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA}\\;(Gen),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\;(\\alpha)\\ [A\\equiv_\\alpha^{Pocket}B].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA}\\;(Gen),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\;(\\alpha)\\ [A\\equiv_\\alpha^{Pocket}B].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>-证明中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Gen)\">\\((Gen)\\)</span> 带有第 4 条的新鲜性条件。对应关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Pocket}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Pocket}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}^{Pocket}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}^{Pocket}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{Pocket}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},A\\equiv_\\alpha^{Pocket}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{Pocket}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{Pocket}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限公式列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{n-1}=A\">\\(A_{n-1}=A\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Pocket}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall xA_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(B)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket}(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Pocket}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{Pocket}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{Pocket}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{Pocket}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{Pocket}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Pocket}=(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket},\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},\\Delta_0^{Pocket},\\operatorname{PocketSepOK},\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket},\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{SubT}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{Sub}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{Pocket},\\equiv_\\alpha^{Pocket},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}^{-},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Pocket},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}^{Pocket},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Pocket},\\operatorname{Proof}_{Pocket},\\vdash_{Pocket}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Pocket}=(\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket},\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket},\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket},\\Delta_0^{Pocket},\\operatorname{PocketSepOK},\\operatorname{FV}_{T}^{Pocket},\\operatorname{FV}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{BV}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{SubT}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{Sub}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{Pocket},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{Pocket},\\equiv_\\alpha^{Pocket},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}^{-},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{Pocket},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}^{Pocket},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{Pocket},\\operatorname{Proof}_{Pocket},\\vdash_{Pocket}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异由精确弱核心 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}^{-}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pocket}^{-}\\)</span> 给出：仅含外延、空集、配对、并集、基础和带局部变量条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>-分离。相对 BCST，它不含集合归纳；相对 KP，它不含无穷和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>-收集；相对 ZF，它还不含幂集、替代或选择。该系统只含句法对象、句法操作、公理集合、推理规则和证明关系；不含解释结构、语义满足、真值定义、模型类或元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始语言","text":"1. 原始语言","level":1},{"id":"1.1-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$","text":"1.1 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$","level":1},{"id":"2.-有界公式","text":"2. 有界公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-Pocket-公理族","text":"3. Pocket 公理族","level":1},{"id":"4.-规则、证明与系统","text":"4. 规则、证明与系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}_{Pocket}(X)=v_m,","display":true},{"tex":"m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{in}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{Pocket}","display":false},